---
const title = 'My Super Simple Software Factory (For Agentic Engineers)';
---
<figure class="video-wrap">
  <div class="video-frame">
    <iframe
      src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/haUfb1ievTE"
      title={title}
      loading="lazy"
      allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
      allowfullscreen
    ></iframe>
  </div>
  <figcaption style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.92rem;">
    <strong style="color: var(--text);">The reference.</strong> IndyDevDan walks
    through the original factory — the three principles, live runs, the trace,
    and the SDLC workflow — and explains why <em>agents plus code beats agents
    alone</em>. This project is a repackaging of that system as a global CLI.
    <span style="display:block; margin-top:10px; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-faint);">
      IndyDevDan · youtube.com/@indydevdan
    </span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
